NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager.dispatchTodo kind=method
  digest=b3:2ad589316eaaadac353bd4e47f32cd47c0819dcb8eebc902f321fc79d672223c file=neo/internal/tools/tools.go range=528:559 lang=go exported=false byte_range=20567:22196
  sig=func (m *Manager) dispatchTodo(ctx context.Context, args map[string]interface{}) (string, bool, error)
  doc=dispatchTodo is the live task-list handler (neo-smoothness req.3). It parses\nthe model's ordered plan, ENFORCES the lifecycle invariants — at most one\nitem in_progress at a time (req.3.2) — and surfaces the list through the\ninjected emitter. It no-ops gracefully on a trivial single-step turn (req.3.4)\nso the feature adds visibility on real multi-step work without ceremony.\nValidation failures are returned in-band (isError=true, err=nil) so the model\nreads the steer and corrects rather than the harness retrying.
EDGES
  calls=matrix/neo/internal/server.Engine.emitTodo,matrix/neo/internal/tools.parseTodoItems,matrix/neo/internal/tools.summarizeTodo
  references=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager,matrix/neo/internal/tools.TodoInProgress,matrix/neo/internal/tools.args,matrix/neo/internal/tools.ctx,matrix/neo/internal/tools.err,matrix/neo/internal/tools.inProgress,matrix/neo/internal/tools.it,matrix/neo/internal/tools.items,matrix/neo/internal/tools.m,matrix/neo/internal/tools.parseTodoItems,matrix/neo/internal/tools.summarizeTodo
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager
  ^calls=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager.Dispatch
